{"id":"n42941-1-10","stage":4,"title":"노하다 · 怒","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42941-1-10-1","ko":"선생님이 갑자기 나한테 불같이 노하셨어.","zh":"老师突然对我大发雷霆呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선생님이","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님이","audio":"/audio/1f942b077ca4a24be3b8.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"나한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나한테","audio":"/audio/a650b718a38da6e97157.mp3"}},{"text":"불같이","meaning":"火，热情","explanation":"불：火，热情；같이：表示“像……一样”；在时间词后也可强调该时间。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"4","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불같이","audio":"/audio/b12cc73b0163d898ae1c.mp3"}},{"text":"노하셨어.","meaning":"怒，发怒","explanation":"노하다：怒，发怒；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"노하다","audio":"/audio/5127412e4db825465cd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42941","senseId":"1","lemma":"노하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노하셨어","audio":"/audio/bf6f69665815b4dfe937.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"老师，教师","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"(敬语)教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火，热情","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"(喻义)像火一样熊熊燃烧的情感。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"5127412e4db82546","term":"노하다","zh":"怒，发怒","audio":"/audio/5127412e4db825465cd0.mp3","entryId":"42941","definition":"(文雅)发火；或指生气。","pronunciation":["노ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a78b080dfd092128acaa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42941-1-10-2","ko":"그래서 안에서 화내는 목소리가 들렸구나.","zh":"原来是这样，所以才听到里面传来发怒的声音啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以。","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}},{"text":"안에서","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안에서","audio":"/audio/dbb8d679f920a84351c8.mp3"}},{"text":"화내는","meaning":"发火，生气","explanation":"화내다：发火，生气；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"화내다","audio":"/audio/6a08b78017242e5e9619.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87954","senseId":"1","lemma":"화내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화내는","audio":"/audio/5b1b331dbdfa7531bf40.mp3"}},{"text":"목소리가","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목소리가","audio":"/audio/74012d13a64ca3e5b621.mp3"}},{"text":"들렸구나.","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들렸구나","audio":"/audio/e8ca0c0e6a21b9f31589.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6a08b78017242e5e","term":"화내다","zh":"发火，生气","audio":"/audio/6a08b78017242e5e9619.mp3","entryId":"87954","definition":"表现出心情非常不好，有怒气的感情。","pronunciation":["화ː내다"]},{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2cca8a7b18243306eabe.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42941","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["老师突然对我大发雷霆呢。","原来是这样，所以才听到里面传来发怒的声音啊。","你最近在读的书是讲什么的？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["老师突然对我大发雷霆呢。","原来是这样，所以才听到里面传来发怒的声音啊。","你最近在读的书是讲什么的？"],"answer":1}]}
